commit 71c0ea1efd7159c40f5456de57f7096c4a2c3f5a
Author: wayne1007 <tony90107@icloud.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 4 18:57:09 2026 +0800

    feat(routing): a model proposes the study purpose and deterministic rules verify it (Log 355)
    
    After routing, one strict call (role study_purpose, the semantic model)
    proposes the comparison design and up to three conclusions, each with an
    exact quote. verify_proposal keeps only what the quote supports: it must be
    in the request, carry a cue for its value, not be negated before or after
    (the witnesses' rules, PN, CN), not be "predict the target genes", name a
    regulator for a regulator change, show a contrast for groups, and not be a
    technical or two-data-type pairing; a group difference needs a verified
    design. The verified reading is state (study_purpose); the reply layer and
    cards read it, and fall back to the word witnesses when the call is not
    configured, blocked or fails. No decision field changes.
    
    Pinned call-sequence tests gain the one study_purpose call (declared in Log 355).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

